sequenceDiagram
    participant EXT as External User
    participant CLIENT as Client/Project Team
    participant PM as Project Management
    participant INGEST as Data Ingestion
    participant ADLS as Landing Zone (ADLS)
    participant DBX as Azure Databricks (Spark)
    participant STAGE as Staging Zone
    participant SQL as Metadata Store (Azure SQL)
    participant COSMOS as Metadata Store (Cosmos DB)
    participant OBIE as Data Processing (OBIE Engine)

    %% 1 - Initiation
    PM->>INGEST: 1. Project Data, Engagement Rollforward
    
    %% 2 - Ingestion
    EXT-->>INGEST: 2. 5a, 5b. Data Upload
    Note right of INGEST: Validate and stage incoming data

    INGEST->>ADLS: 3. Raw data files
    
    %% 4 - Split Metadata flows from Data Ingestion
    INGEST->>SQL: 4a. Client Relational Meta Data (Audit Logs)
    INGEST->>COSMOS: 4b. Client JSON Config (Engagement Tags)

    %% 5 & 6 - Processing
    ADLS->>DBX: 5. Process raw data
    Note right of DBX: Data transformation, quality checks,<br/>staging prep

    DBX->>STAGE: 6. Cleansed data

    %% 7 & 8 - OBIE Interaction
    STAGE->>OBIE: 7. Client Financial Data
    CLIENT->>OBIE: 8. Data staged via Databricks for OBIE processing

    %% 11 - Split Metadata flows from Databricks
    DBX->>SQL: 11a. Transformation Status & Metrics
    DBX->>COSMOS: 11b. Enriched Meta Data Schema Updates

    Note over DBX,SQL: Multi-store synchronization complete